  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C).",
    "In a large skillet, melt butter over medium heat.",
    "Add the cubed bread and cook until golden brown, about 5 minutes.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together almond milk, flour, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Pour the milk mixture over the toasted bread and stir until coated.",
    "Transfer the bread mixture to a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
    "Sprinkle the shredded cheeses over the top.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot.",
    "Let the casserole rest for 10 minutes before serving."
